)IMHO the most important factor in game design is fun factor.  I don't
)care who gets the highest score, I like the game to be fun.  Perhaps we
)need something between explore mode, where you start with a WoW, and
)the regular game.  Perhaps we can set the difficulty level by
)enabling/disabling certain tricks like polypiling, rings of conflict,
)certain shop robbing tricks, etc.  Taking out those tricks could affect
)some fun aspect of the game.  Variety is the spice of life.  Making the
